cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these certificates, cite the monograph as the authority and the artefact you actually ran."
title: "QGT verification certificates: B1 symbolic verifier and B0+B1 Lean 4 formal pilot"
abstract: >-
  Two machine-checkable counterparts to Appendix E of The Quantum Gauge Theory
  of Time, First Edition. B1 is a symbolic-executable coherence verifier in
  Python/SymPy; the formal pilot re-proves the arithmetic core in Lean 4, with
  no external dependency and no custom axiom. Neither establishes the physical
  truth of the theory nor the empirical identity of the projection invariant
  with the measured fine-structure constant.
type: software
